# Trivy accepted-until-upstream ignore list (#897b gate escape hatch).
#
# Policy: only FIXABLE CRITICAL/HIGH findings that cannot be remediated at a
# real control point in this repo belong here. The gate already runs with
# `ignore-unfixed: true`, so the ~104 unfixed Debian CVEs (no vendor patch)
# are NOT listed — they are suppressed by that flag, not by this file.
#
# Every entry MUST carry: the finding ID, the package + version, WHY it can't
# be fixed here, and a tracking/expiry note. Review each entry on every
# release; drop it the moment the real fix lands upstream.
